        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BST2003SBRRR, Boston Floral Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Large Floral Knob is designed as a dummy only. It is used as a door pull or as door decoration. This style door knob pull was first made popular in large European homes; and was often placed in the center of doors. The Boston 02 Knob may also be used on large furniture such as armoires or cabinets. The Large Floral Decorative Door Knob is cast in solid brass and assembled in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BST02-specifications.gif?v=1704354523\" width=\"307\" height=\"240\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impression BST2003SBRRR Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions BST2003SBRRR Large Boston Series Decorative Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 3.31\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 4.14\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.14\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BST02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262231\"><b>First Impressions BST2003SBRRR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Knob pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Knob pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Knob pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door knob pull handle with rosette). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Boston 2 Knob | Large Floral Knob Pull",
                "description": "This Large Floral Knob is designed as a dummy only. It is used as a door pull or as door decoration. This style door knob pull was first made popular in large European homes; and was often placed in the center of doors. The Boston 02 Knob may also be used on large furniture such as armoires or cabinets. The Large Floral Decorative Door Knob is cast in solid brass and assembled in the USA.\r\n",
                "keywords": "FII-1007 European Decorative Door Knobs, First Impressions 1007 Large European Decorative Door Knobs, large center door knob pulls, big knobs, big door knobs, large knobs, FII-BST02, Large Boston Series Decorative Door Knobs, First Impressions BST02, Large Floral Decorative Door Knobs, Boston 02 Knobs, Boston Floral Door Pulls, FII-BST2003SBRRR, First Impressions BST2003SBRRR"
            },
